Bharata bids Kaikeyi fall from kingdom to hell --- Bharata calls mother demoness defiling family --- Bharata says Rama exile brings worldwide infamy --- Surabhi sees burdened ox sons ploughing and weeps --- Indra asks cause and Surabhi praises son love --- Thousand-sonned cow grieves what of sonless Kausalya --- Bharata vows to honor brother father and fame --- Bharata vows to fetch Rama then enter forest --- Bharata falls senseless like Indra banner fallen
